     A*
     A* - EOS Bill Transmission Information
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Created on 10/31/2001 by C:62 for Project 96MEN
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Purpose: This file will hold the member #, date/time uploaded,
     A*          date/time converted, and date/time processed of the
     A*          "batch" of bills received from EOS.
     A*****************************************************************
     A* REVISIONS
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PO901                     TEXT('EOS Bill Trans Info')
     A            O9DCID    R               REFFLD(DCID)
     A                                      COLHDG('Shared folder doc ID')
     A            O9MBR#    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('FAO0P member #')
     A            O9ULDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Upload Date')
     A*           Upload date when FAO9P record created, FAO9P Member
     A*           name assigned
     A*
     A            O9ULTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Upload Time')
     A            O9CVDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Convert Date')
     A*           Convert date when data converted from FAO0P file to
     A*           FAO1P and FA02P
     A*
     A            O9CVTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Convert Time')
     A            O9PRDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Process Date')
     A*           Process date when all FAO1P records have a value
     A*           in S1PRFL for a given "batch".  This will prevent
     A*           the document in EOS from appearing on the "Upload
     A*           EOS Bills" screen, since all the FAO1P records
     A*           have been processed.  We don't want to process that
     A*           member again.
     A*
     A            O9PRTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Process Time')
     A*
     A            O9STAT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Status')
     A            O9USER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint User')
     A            O9PGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Program')
     A            O9TIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Time')
     A            O9DT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Date')
     A            O9IUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial User')
     A            O9IPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Program')
     A            O9ITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Time')
     A            O9IDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Date')
